## Items + ingredients (owner rpg-core). Re-exported as Data.ITEMS and Data.INGREDIENTS.
## Item fields: name, kind (consumable|throwable|weapon|armor|charm|key|dish), price (buy; sell = price/2), desc, icon.
## Consumable/dish effect keys (all optional, used by BattleEngine.apply_item and the field menu):
##   heal (flat HP), heal_pct (0..1 of max HP), mp, mp_pct, revive (fraction of max HP), cure [status ids],
##   status {id, turns} (applied to target), gauge (Fondue gauge), target (ally|all_allies|ally_down|enemy|all_enemies),
##   damage (fixed power for throwables, scaled by user lck), element.
## Equipment: slot (weapon|armor|charm), who [character ids] (empty = anyone), stats {atk, def, mag, res, spd, lck, hp, mp},
##   element (weapon attack element), resist [elements], immune [statuses].
## Ingredient fields: name, tags (dairy|herb|veg|fruit|spice|grain|protein|sweet|fancy|cheese|drink|nut|sea|rot-cure),
##   flavor (one of the 4 flavour notes: savory|sweet|sharp|earthy|fresh|rich), price, where (flavour text), desc.

